      "title": "File:Artemis I Rocket Beauty Shots (KSC-20220630-PH-KLS01 0124).jpeg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/Artemis_I_Rocket_Beauty_Shots_%28KSC-20220630-PH-KLS01_0124%29.jpeg",
